[I] A C library implementing the Javascript Object Signing and Encryption

[T] cjose is a C library implementing the JOSE standards: JSON Web
[T] Signature, JSON Web Encryption, JSON Web Key and JSON Web Algorithms.
[T] This is a maintained fork of the original Cisco project.

[U] https://github.com/OpenIDC/cjose/

